PLIP - Protein-ligand interaction Profiler

It automatically detects & analyzes non-covalent interactions between proteins & ligands.
***Different type of interactions
1. hydrogen bonds
2. hydrophobic contacts
3. pi-pi stacking 
4. salt bridges
5. Halogen bonds
6. Water bridges.

- 3D Visualizations / tables / reports

Applications:
-helps to understand drug-target binding clearly.
-Imp for drug discovery, docking analysis, structural biology 

Instead of manual interactions in PyMol

